            {
                "entry_id": "da14eb77-0a8f-38e4-82f4-b05967f2b770",
                "word": "télépathe",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "557c8766-508b-40b2-9191-1a524b3a41a1",
                        "entry_id": "da14eb77-0a8f-38e4-82f4-b05967f2b770",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "télépathes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39bac04b-4d8f-36cc-b175-c03c2829bdb1",
                        "entry_id": "da14eb77-0a8f-38e4-82f4-b05967f2b770",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne douée de télépathie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71783053-ae83-4d40-b1ce-2e37eaba3904",
                                "sense_id": "39bac04b-4d8f-36cc-b175-c03c2829bdb1",
                                "text": "Les télépathes se répartissent en deux catégories distinctes, les autotélépathes qui approfondissent le gnothi seauton socratique, et les pseudotélépathes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06702697-70c2-4dc3-b157-a2eed1863110",
                                "sense_id": "39bac04b-4d8f-36cc-b175-c03c2829bdb1",
                                "text": "— Je suis cireur de bottes, monsieur ; et aussi commissionnaire. Mais tout cela ne serait rien. Je suis télépathe.\n— Hein ?\n— Télépathe.\n— Parfaitement.\n— Je reçois et je transmets la pensée à travers la distance. M. Broudier est un de mes abonnés."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c49e5dc3-477c-42fe-85f3-cb9f1d25f35d",
                        "source_entry_id": "da14eb77-0a8f-38e4-82f4-b05967f2b770",
                        "source_sense_id": "39bac04b-4d8f-36cc-b175-c03c2829bdb1",
                        "target_lang_word": "telepath",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "telepath",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24e7359d-7bcf-3ced-b6e3-f00aa0d12a90",
                                        "entry_id": "55176817-62bc-3463-934b-45d50cea2a42",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with telepathic ability, capable of reading the thoughts of others around them. Telepaths also have the ability to project thought."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "telepath",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ccee848-6a99-3079-9603-9f4de3bb61e3",
                                        "entry_id": "1e4a510e-b075-3e50-b71e-aee2e317c1ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To communicate by thought; to use telepathy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8b6374a-27c8-4841-a250-190e6127356c",
                                                "sense_id": "5ccee848-6a99-3079-9603-9f4de3bb61e3",
                                                "text": "Jan. 3rd, 1984.—I was in the front sitting-room and dare not go out of the room for the cold; my plants were awfully dry, and hearing E. [her niece] in the kitchen, I telepathed to her to bring me in some water. She at once came with a jug full and asked if I would water the plants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63ca537d-eaf9-4a0b-a6d7-9cb4441f5145",
                                                "sense_id": "5ccee848-6a99-3079-9603-9f4de3bb61e3",
                                                "text": "He does not attribute one single experience to what we might term a \"ghost\" for lack of a better term. Witches, poltergeists, goblins, gremlins, fairies, dwarfs—all of them are real, physical, alive, being either the real thing or the teleported or telepathed image of the real thing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25db0929-a78b-4c26-b598-1e0c4b9bd7fb",
                                                "sense_id": "5ccee848-6a99-3079-9603-9f4de3bb61e3",
                                                "text": "Thanos: \"Did you not suspect I could tell you had been telepathing?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4645a1e6-09ed-4b38-b80b-b5a884fc1deb",
                                                "sense_id": "5ccee848-6a99-3079-9603-9f4de3bb61e3",
                                                "text": "In your mind you have capacities you know / To telepath messages through the vast unknown"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12cf3714-1550-4363-8f13-51910b68b40b",
                        "source_entry_id": "da14eb77-0a8f-38e4-82f4-b05967f2b770",
                        "source_sense_id": "39bac04b-4d8f-36cc-b175-c03c2829bdb1",
                        "target_lang_word": "telepatico",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4f25294c-6307-4b40-90cb-a4bdf11ba84e",
                        "source_entry_id": "da14eb77-0a8f-38e4-82f4-b05967f2b770",
                        "source_sense_id": "39bac04b-4d8f-36cc-b175-c03c2829bdb1",
                        "target_lang_word": "телепат",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "телепат",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39d934cb-e95d-3d5d-9277-211ee0bbb4fd",
                                        "entry_id": "9462d2eb-25c9-3856-9dcd-98ca23aaa5f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. тот, кто обладает телепатическими способностями, то есть способен передавать и читать чужие мысли на расстоянии без помощи достоверно известных науке способов передачи информации"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "318bbb35-dc50-4748-8f9c-d399f49b192b",
                                                "sense_id": "39d934cb-e95d-3d5d-9277-211ee0bbb4fd",
                                                "text": "Термин «чтение мышц» (muscle-reading) появился в Америке. Психолог Джордж Бёрд ввёл его в оборот в 1874 году, объясняя феномен телепата Джекоба Рендалла Брауна."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e33cd1d9-8bfa-49c8-b19d-4b6bcc6b61af",
                                                "sense_id": "39d934cb-e95d-3d5d-9277-211ee0bbb4fd",
                                                "text": "Телепат, способный в некоторых случаях читать чужие мысли, он подчас с высокой точностью разгадывал намерения собеседника."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
